  "details": "Sonatype Nexus Repository 3 contains a SQL injection vulnerability in the optional \"Reindex Search Tables By Pattern\" task. A user who holds the nexus:tasks:create privilege can supply a crafted filter condition that the database runs as SQL. This allows the user to modify data in the Nexus database. The task is available only when the non-default setting nexus.reindex.search.by.pattern.visible is set to true.",
